# Aquacorde Town (and its rooms): the riverside town of the old bridge and the café on the waterfront, a
# bright clarinet tune in D (plan 23 · Z1's tune, arranged again) over a nylon guitar and a light brushed step, the
# water going by under it, with a flute answering in the softer middle section in G; at night an oboe and a harp.
# Original composition for this game (plan 31 · MU3), in the modern sound.
